  "contracts": [
    "Normal publication JSON omits recovery_origin and preserves original grant semantics.",
    "Recovery origin requires version, bounded operation, complete fleet identity and four canonical SHA256 digests.",
    "Actual generation manifest and complete private recovery inputs must match their origin digests.",
    "RecoveryOrigin is mutually exclusive with every nonzero Lease field, including expiry alone.",
    "Expected predecessor identity and revision stay exact; no revision overflow or identity replacement.",
    "Read, ValidateFleetRecovery and ValidateFleetReplay remain passive and confer no approval, lease, authority receipt or inference permission.",
    "Adoption preserves original recovery-origin identity and complete catalog/input bytes while selecting a later approved identity.",
    "fleetCommitStore.Commit and both normal test store adapters call ValidateRefreshPublication; recovery-origin requests never reach ordinary publication dispatch.",
    "Runtime retains zero publication grant for imported facts. Later refresh requires a real lease and publishes a normal grant under a new revision, preserving old evidence unchanged."
  ],
